# Backend host only — no trailing slash, no /api suffix (the client appends /api).
# Leave UNSET in development (Vite proxy → localhost:3000) and on Netlify, where
# /api/* is proxied same-origin to the backend (required for cookie auth).
# Set it only for direct, non-proxied deployments.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
